# nav-probe actions: Rise of the Witch-king from the main menu to a skirmish, then two
# minutes of in-game sensors. Same APT layout family as BFME II; the layout is captured
# before each click so a moved button shows up in the log (uimap rows) rather than silently.
dbg d3d9DirectPresent true
wait 20
uimap
click 217,556
wait 2
uimap
quick click 217,381
wait 6
uimap
texlist
quick click 704,573
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
dbg faults
dbg messageBoxes
uimap
quit
